        "name": "Dark Sphere",
        "description": "Syndra conjures a Dark Sphere dealing magic damage. The sphere remains and can be manipulated by her other powers.",
        "tooltip": "Syndra conjures a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dark Sphere</span>, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(90/125/160/195/230 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dark Sphere</span> remains for 6 seconds and can be manipulated by Syndra's other Abilities.<br /><br /><span> Splinters of Wrath</span>: Syndra can store 2 charges of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dark Sphere</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability can be cast while moving.</span>",
